    {
      "type_code": "assertion",
      "label": "检查操作",
      "sort": 5,
      "methods": [
        {"method_code":"assertion.element.match","method_version":1,"label":"检查页面元素","description":"读取指定元素的文本或输入值，并按包含、等于、不包含、正则或可见性进行检查。","legacy_action":"web-assert-element-match","action_type":"assert_element_match","form_schema":[{"name":"target_ref","label":"目标元素","component":"locator","required":true,"placeholder":"例如：css=.result-message","help":"支持 css=选择器或 xpath=表达式。1"},{"name":"read_mode","label":"读取方式","component":"select","required":false,"default":"auto","tooltip":"- `auto`\n  - `input`、`textarea`、`select`：读取 DOM 的 `value`\n  - 其他元素：读取 `innerText`，必要时回退到 `textContent`\n- `text`\n  - 强制读取元素文本\n- `value`\n  - 强制读取 DOM 的 `value` 属性值，不是 HTML 的 `value` 属性","options":[{"label":"自动","value":"auto","help":"推荐：输入控件读取 DOM 的 value，普通元素读取 innerText，适合同时处理输入框和页面文本。"},{"label":"元素文本","value":"text","help":"强制读取元素文本，适合 span、div、提示信息和 contenteditable，不读取输入控件的 value。"},{"label":"输入值","value":"value","help":"强制读取 DOM value 属性值，适合 input、textarea、select；普通 span 或 div 通常为空。"}]},{"name":"match_mode","label":"匹配方式","component":"select","required":true,"tooltip":"- `contains`：实际值包含期望值，文本比较会规范化空白\n- `equals`：规范化后的实际值与期望值完全相等\n- `not_contains`：实际值不包含期望值\n- `regex`：使用 JavaScript `RegExp` 在原始读取值上匹配\n- `visible`：只检查元素是否可见，不需要期望值","options":[{"label":"包含","value":"contains","help":"实际值包含期望值；文本比较会按运行时规则规范化空白。"},{"label":"等于","value":"equals","help":"规范化后的实际值与期望值完全相等。"},{"label":"不包含","value":"not_contains","help":"实际值不包含期望值。"},{"label":"正则匹配","value":"regex","help":"使用 JavaScript RegExp 在原始读取值上匹配，请填写合法的 JavaScript 正则表达式。"},{"label":"元素可见","value":"visible","help":"只检查元素是否可见，不需要填写期望值。"}]},{"name":"expect","label":"期望值","component":"input","required":false,"help":"包含、等于、不包含和正则模式下的比较目标；元素可见模式不需要填写。","required_when":{"match_mode":["contains","equals","not_contains","regex"]},"visible_when":{"match_mode":["contains","equals","not_contains","regex"]},"placeholder":"例如：系统管理平台"}],"capabilities":{"selenium":"implemented","playwright":"implemented","cuecast":"implemented"}},
